    "title": "Everything you need to know about the ‘Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special’ — How to watch, premiere time, who’s coming back and more",
    "text": "The limo is out front … and Miley Cyrus is stepping out as Hannah Montana once more. That’s right, Miley’s putting the blonde wig back on for a special anniversary celebration of her hit Disney Channel Original Series. Premiering March 24 on Disney+, the Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special will feature a sit-down interview between Miley and Hannah Montana superfan Alex Cooper (host of \"Call Her Daddy\"). Fans will also get to see recreated sets from the show, a performance of “The Best of Both Worlds,” and emotional chats with Miley’s mom, Tish Cyrus, and her dad and Hannah Montana costar, Billy Ray Cyrus. Are you ready for Hannah Montana’s return? Here’s how to watch the Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special.Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special trailer:When does the Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special come out?The Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special comes out on Tuesday, March 24. Disney+ titles tend to drop at 3 a.m. ET/12 a.m. PT on their premiere date.How to watch the Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary SpecialIs the original cast coming back for the Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special?The people appearing on the Hannah Montana anniversary include:Miley CyrusBilly Ray CyrusTish CyrusAlex CooperSelena GomezEmily Osment (Lilly), Mitchel Musso (Oliver), Jason Earles (Jackson), Moisés Arias (Rico) and Dolly Parton (Aunt Dolly) are all listed in the credits of the upcoming special, but it is unclear if they will appear in person or just in old clips.Is Hannah Montana getting a reboot?The 20th anniversary special episode of Hannah Montana is not a reboot; it’s a series of interviews with Miley about the show with Alex Cooper and a few other familiar faces. But this special doesn’t rule out the possibility of an actual reboot, one day…How to watch Hannah Montana The original series is available to stream in its entirety on Disney+. You can also watch Hannah Montana: The Movie on Disney+.",
